{"id":"n30190-1-27","stage":1,"title":"시계 · 钟","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30190-1-27-1","ko":"이 시계는 고장이 난 것 같아.","zh":"这手表好像坏了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시계는","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시계","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30190","senseId":"1","lemma":"시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고장이","meaning":"故障","explanation":"고장：故障；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고장","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18856","senseId":"1","lemma":"고장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"난","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"a658dc1b94077c9f","term":"시계","zh":"钟，表","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3","entryId":"30190","definition":"指示时间的仪器。","pronunciation":["시계","시게"]},{"id":"a