]},{"text":"시계는","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시계","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30190","senseId":"1","lemma":"시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열두","meaning":"十；两","explanation":"열：十；두：两","readings":[{"term":"열","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"},{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67805","senseId":"1","lemma":"열","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시잖아.","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"大概","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"大约估计。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"a658dc1b94077c9f","term":"시계","zh":"钟，表","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3","entryId":"30190","definition":"指示时间的仪器。","pronunciation":["시계","시게"]},{"id":"6f4112362e973dd6","term":"열","zh":"十","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3","entryId":"67805","definition":"九加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["